    <section class="section container scroll-reveal">
      <div class="section-heading center">
        <div class="eyebrow">FROM SETUP TO INSIGHT</div>
        <h2>Your office, connected in three steps.</h2>
        <p>A simple start. A live view. A more informed way to work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-number">01</span>
          <h3>Enroll your workstations</h3>
          <p>Install the visible workstation agent and connect each device with its department code.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-number">02</span>
          <h3>Watch your floor come alive</h3>
          <p>Place devices on your floor maps and see workstation and team statuses update live.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <span class="step-number">03</span>
          <h3>Report, connect &amp; act</h3>
          <p>Turn activity into useful reports, send targeted announcements and offer consent-based support.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="roles">
        <article class="role">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          <div>
            <h4>Admin</h4>
            <p>Manage branches, devices, settings and the complete operation.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="role">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
