    <section id="privacy" class="section privacy-section">
      <div class="container privacy-layout scroll-reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div class="eyebrow"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg> PRIVACY ISN'T AN AFTERTHOUGHT</div>
            <h2>Understand your office.<br />Respect your people.</h2>
            <p>Operational visibility should build trust, not erode it. OfficeOps keeps consent and transparency at the center.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="list-check">
            <li>Consent-first monitoring, with visible workstation agents.</li>
            <li>Microphone state transitions and durations only — never audio.</li>
            <li>Peer-to-peer screen sharing. Screen media never passes through the API.</li>
            <li>Automatic data retention and audit logs for accountability.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="privacy-statement"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg> Not hidden surveillance. Agents run visibly. Always.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img class="privacy-image" src="./assets/office.jpg" alt="Kenyan professionals working together in a modern, open call-center office" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="privacy-caption"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/></svg> Better visibility. Stronger teams. Mutual trust.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="pricing" class="section container scroll-reveal">
      <div class="section-heading center">
        <div class="eyebrow">A PLAN FOR EVERY OPERATION</div>
        <h2>Clear pricing. Room to grow.</h2>
        <p>Start with the visibility you need. Add capabilities as your team grows.<br />Monthly subscriptions in Kenyan shillings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <article class="price-card">
